      "html": "<div class=\"ds-qs\"><div class=\"ds-qt ds-qt-on\"><button class=\"ds-qt-main\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"15\" r=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M5.6 12.4a6.2 6.2 0 0 1 8.8 0l1.1-1.1a7.8 7.8 0 0 0-11 0Zm-2.8-2.8a10.2 10.2 0 0 1 14.4 0l1.1-1.1a11.8 11.8 0 0 0-16.6 0Z\"/></svg><span><b>Wi-Fi</b><small>Home 5G</small></span></button></div><div class=\"ds-qt\"><button class=\"ds-qt-main\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M10 3a7 7 0 0 1 0 14Z\"/></svg><span><b>Dark Style</b></span></button></div></div>",
