      "description": "GNOME top bar: near-black translucent panel with pill buttons.",
      "html": "<header class=\"ds-tbar\"><button class=\"ds-pb\" aria-label=\"Activities\"><span class=\"ds-ws ds-ws-on\"></span><span class=\"ds-ws\"></span></button><button class=\"ds-pb ds-clock\">Sat, Oct 3  5:39 PM</button><button class=\"ds-pb\" aria-label=\"System menu\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M2 6h1.5v4H2zM5 5h1.5v6H5zM8 4h1.5v8H8zM11 3h1.5v10H11z\"/></svg></button></header>",
      "css": ".ds-tbar{font-family:'Montserrat Variable',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;height:32px;padding:0 4px;background:var(--panel,rgb(14 14 14/.92));color:var(--panel-fg,#f7f7f7)}.ds-tbar>.ds-pb:first-child{justify-self:start}.ds-tbar>.ds-pb:last-child{justify-self:end}.ds-pb{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;height:26px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:none;color:inherit;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms}.ds-pb:hover{background:rgb(255 255 255/.15)}.ds-pb:active{background:rgb(255 255 255/.25)}.ds-pb:focus-visible{outline:2px solid color-mix(in oklab,var(--brand,#e95420) 55%,transparent)}.ds-clock{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:pre}.ds-ws{height:7px;width:7px;border-radius:9999px;background:rgb(247 247 247/.5)}.ds-ws-on{width:22px;background:#f7f7f7}"
